abstract: "A public release of Finite Contact Theory, a long-range finite reconstruction program. This v0.1 chapter grows the Bell/CHSH quantum boundary from a finite one-use floor at binary-Bell scope, with scoped theorem rows, a correction ledger, and a shipped verification subset; generalizations are held open by name."
